#: scenario3:scenario3_60039B01_194E_401F_887A_8CA90615E312
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d91a64369d1de98723847c58bba7e52419ac1c4828aa10df38326a84f131ffc
